cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LAFC-Evict: Learning-Augmented Cache Eviction Dataset"
message: "If you use this repository or dataset, please cite LAFC-Evict and the associated research work."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Vahidi"
    given-names: "Soroush"
    affiliation: "New Jersey Institute of Technology"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SoroushVahidi/lafc-evict-dataset"
abstract: >-
  LAFC-Evict v1.0 is the current full public release: a five-family
  (Alibaba Block, MetaCDN, MetaKV, Twemcache, Wiki2018) derived dataset for
  learning-augmented cache-eviction research, containing 277,995,072
  candidate-level rows across 2,363,286 decisions plus a 1,000,000-row
  canonical pairwise sample. It is published on the `v1.0` branch/revision
  of the Hugging Face repository below; the prior wiki2018-only v0.3 release
  remains published unchanged on the `main` branch/revision.
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
license: "Multi-licensed by family -- CC0-1.0 (wiki2018), CC BY 4.0 (Alibaba Block, Twemcache), Apache License 2.0 (MetaCDN, MetaKV). See THIRD_PARTY_DATA.md."
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21895843"
    description: "Zenodo concept DOI, current version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21895844 identifies v0.2 only. No Zenodo version exists yet for v0.3 or v1.0; do not cite the concept DOI as identifying v1.0."
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "LAFC-Evict: A Large-Scale Counterfactual Benchmark for Learned Cache Eviction"
  authors:
    - family-names: "Vahidi"
      given-names: "Soroush"
  year: 2026
  notes: >-
    Submitted manuscript for Performance Evaluation. No journal DOI, volume,
    issue, or page numbers have been assigned as of this release; do not cite
    the LAFC-Evict dataset's Zenodo DOI as this article's DOI. Cite the
    dataset itself using the host/version being used; the Zenodo DOI above
    identifies the v0.2 archival line, not v1.0.
keywords:
  - "cache eviction"
  - "caching"
  - "learning-augmented algorithms"
  - "counterfactual supervision"
  - "dataset"
